---
import WebLayout from '../../../layouts/WebLayout.astro';
---

<WebLayout title="Kylie's Cyber Sanctuary" description="Kylie's digital realm in cyberspace, established November 1997.">


  <div style="text-align:center">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px">✨ Kylie's Cyber Sanctuary ✨</h1>
    <p style="font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:13px">~ welcome to my digital realm in cyberspace ~</p>
    <p style="font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:12px">established November 1997</p>
    <marquee scrollamount="5" style="background:#800080;color:#ffff00;padding:3px;border:2px inset #ff66ff;font-family:'Courier New',monospace">
      ★ NOW PLAYING: pants-theme.mid ★ SIGN MY GUESTBOOK ★ CHECK OUT MY FRIENDS ★ BEST VIEWED IN 800x600 ★
    </marquee>
  </div>

  <div class="web-columns">
    <div>
      <h2>Welcome!</h2>
      <p>
        Hi! I'm Kylie. This is my website. I like computers, cats, and making web pages with
        too many animated GIFs. I have been on the internet since 1997 and I still do not
        understand how email works.
      </p>
      <p>
        My friend <a href="/web/">pants</a> helped me set up this page. He says my background
        is "a lot," which I am choosing to interpret as a compliment.
      </p>

      <h2>My Diary</h2>
      <div class="web-panel">
        <h3>Entry #47: my first win32 applet in C++</h3>
        <div class="web-post-date">Nov 02, 1998 // 11:42 PM</div>
        <p>
          I finally got Borland C++ 5.0 installed on my Pentium 166! After 3 hours of debugging
          null pointer exceptions, my little dialog window popped up on the desktop! Next plan is
          building an automated IRC bot for EFnet.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="web-panel">
        <h3>Entry #46: retro webrings &amp; friends!</h3>
        <div class="web-post-date">Oct 28, 1998 // 04:15 PM</div>
        <p>
          Be sure to check out <a href="/web/">pants-the-person's 486 tinkering log</a>! His
          benchmarks on overclocked AMD DX4 chips are totally insane. Also added
          <a href="/web/~pants/">ultimateshades</a> to my cool tech links below!
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>Cool Tech Links</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/web/">Pants Place 98</a> — the best 486 site on the web</li>
        <li><a href="/web/~ultimateshades/">UltimateShades</a> — overclocking shrine</li>
        <li><a href="/web/downloads/">MIDI Archive</a> — free music</li>
        <li><a href="/web/webring/">The Old Net Webring</a> — a ring of cool sites</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <aside>
      <div class="web-panel" style="text-align:center">
        <img src="/icons/computer.svg" width="64" height="64" alt="My computer" />
        <p style="font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:12px">
          Pentium 166<br />32 MB RAM<br />Windows 98
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="web-panel">
        <h3>My Cat</h3>
        <p style="text-align:center;font-size:48px;margin:0">🐈</p>
        <p style="text-align:center;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:12px">His name is Modem.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="web-panel">
        <h3>Guestbook</h3>
        <p>38 entries and counting!</p>
        <p><a href="/web/guestbook/">📖 Sign my guestbook!</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="web-panel" style="text-align:center">
        <p style="font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:12px">BEST VIEWED IN<br /><b>800x600</b><br />16-BIT COLOR</p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:16px">
    <p style="font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:12px">
      [ <a href="/web/webring/">Previous</a> | <a href="/web/webring/">Random</a> | <a href="/web/webring/">Next</a> ]
    </p>
  </div>
</WebLayout>
